WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.059 --> 00:00:16.987
"Mo will never find me here," Cora thought.

2
00:00:16.988 --> 00:00:21.304
She and Mo were playing hide-and-seek.

3
00:00:21.305 --> 00:00:26.470
Cora watched Mo swim around.

4
00:00:26.471 --> 00:00:33.676
Finally Mo spotted her. "I found you, Cora!"

5
00:00:33.677 --> 00:00:39.845
Cora grinned. "Now you hide, Mo!"

6
00:00:39.846 --> 00:00:45.142
She covered her eyes. "One, two, three . . ."

7
00:00:45.143 --> 00:00:48.293
Mo swam away fast.

8
00:00:48.294 --> 00:00:50.403
Lenny hurried over.

9
00:00:50.404 --> 00:00:55.116
The clownfish looked worried.

10
00:00:55.117 --> 00:00:59.807
"Lenny, what's wrong?" Cora asked.

11
00:00:59.808 --> 00:01:06.611
"Sam is trapped in a hole!" Lenny said.

12
00:01:06.612 --> 00:01:11.543
Lenny led Cora to a small hole.

13
00:01:11.544 --> 00:01:18.427
"Don't worry," Cora said. "I'll save him."

14
00:01:18.428 --> 00:01:23.822
Cora squeezed into the hole.

15
00:01:23.823 --> 00:01:27.819
"I don't see Sam," she said.

16
00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:30.800
Cora heard laughter.

17
00:01:30.801 --> 00:01:34.008
She slipped back out.

18
00:01:34.009 --> 00:01:36.506
Sam was with Lenny.

19
00:01:36.507 --> 00:01:45.500
"Ha-ha!" Sam said. "You fell for our trick!"

20
00:01:45.501 --> 00:01:52.917
Cora rolled her eyes. "Very funny."

21
00:01:52.918 --> 00:01:59.535
She swam off and looked for Mo.

22
00:01:59.536 --> 00:02:08.667
Sam shouted, "Shark!"

23
00:02:08.668 --> 00:02:14.211
Cora hurried back to the two clownfish.

24
00:02:14.212 --> 00:02:17.940
"Where's the shark?" Cora asked.

25
00:02:17.941 --> 00:02:21.179
Lenny and Sam laughed again.

26
00:02:21.180 --> 00:02:32.197
"Grr!" Cora swam away.

27
00:02:32.198 --> 00:02:36.413
Later Cora and Mo were eating a snack.

28
00:02:36.414 --> 00:02:39.383
Sam swam over.

29
00:02:39.384 --> 00:02:43.297
"Lenny needs help!" he said.

30
00:02:43.298 --> 00:02:53.515
Cora frowned. "Sorry. I don't believe you!"

